+## Headless fights
+
+The native build also runs one combat on the console, without the web server:
+
+```sh
+dotnet run --project csharp/r2wars.csproj -- --fight examples/pancake.x86-32.asm examples/jordi.x86-32.asm
+```
+
+It prints every round with the winner, the cycles and how the loser died, then
+the winner of the combat or `draw`. The exit code is 0 for a played combat, 1
+when a warrior does not assemble or exceeds the size limit, 2 for bad usage.
+
